{
  "info": {
    "name": "Clinic Scheduler - 061 Celular antes do preco e das datas",
    "description": "O site pede o celular logo depois das areas e o codigo em seguida. A cotacao so honra o celular junto com o token de sessao (24/11): sem token e a de tabela (cadastro null), com token invalido 401, com token valido devolve cadastro.conhecido e o preco da pessoa com o motivo. /verify/confirm devolve paciente {nome, faltam} so depois do codigo; POST /cadastro cria ou completa a ficha SEM agendamento (token obrigatorio); token de sessao 30 min. O codigo vai pelo WhatsApp de verdade tambem em dev: so usar o celular do Andre.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "BASE_URL",
      "value": "https://YOUR_API_GATEWAY_URL.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ENVIRONMENT",
      "value": "dev",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "BOOKING_API_KEY",
      "value": "YOUR_BOOKING_API_KEY_HERE",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "clinicId",
      "value": "clinicadepilacaopremium-3fbce9",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "serviceId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "areaId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "phone",
      "value": "5511970522647",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "code",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Quote sem celular - cadastro null",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"sem celular nao ha cadastro\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().quote.cadastro).to.eql(null));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{BOOKING_API_KEY}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/{{ENVIRONMENT}}/public/clinics/{{clinicId}}/quote",
          "host": [
            "{{BASE_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{ENVIRONMENT}}",
            "public",
            "clinics",
            "{{clinicId}}",
            "quote"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceIds\": [\"{{serviceId}}\"],\n  \"serviceAreaPairs\": [{ \"serviceId\": \"{{serviceId}}\", \"areaId\": \"{{areaId}}\" }]\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Quote com celular SEM token - cotacao cega (site antigo)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const q = pm.response.json().quote;",
              "pm.test(\"celular ignorado: cadastro null\", () => pm.expect(q.cadastro).to.eql(null));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{BOOKING_API_KEY}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/{{ENVIRONMENT}}/public/clinics/{{clinicId}}/quote",
          "host": [
            "{{BASE_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{ENVIRONMENT}}",
            "public",
            "clinics",
            "{{clinicId}}",
            "quote"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceIds\": [\"{{serviceId}}\"],\n  \"serviceAreaPairs\": [{ \"serviceId\": \"{{serviceId}}\", \"areaId\": \"{{areaId}}\" }],\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Revisao de 24/11: sem token o celular nao conta. Antes bastava o celular para ver o desconto de outra pessoa."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Quote com celular e token invalido - 401",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
              "pm.test(\"code\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('TOKEN_INVALIDO'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{BOOKING_API_KEY}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/{{ENVIRONMENT}}/public/clinics/{{clinicId}}/quote",
          "host": [
            "{{BASE_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{ENVIRONMENT}}",
            "public",
            "clinics",
            "{{clinicId}}",
            "quote"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceIds\": [\"{{serviceId}}\"],\n  \"serviceAreaPairs\": [{ \"serviceId\": \"{{serviceId}}\", \"areaId\": \"{{areaId}}\" }],\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"token\": \"x.y.z\"\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Verify send - codigo vai pelo WhatsApp (so o celular do Andre)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{BOOKING_API_KEY}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/{{ENVIRONMENT}}/public/clinics/{{clinicId}}/verify/send",
          "host": [
            "{{BASE_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{ENVIRONMENT}}",
            "public",
            "clinics",
            "{{clinicId}}",
            "verify",
            "send"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{ \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\" }"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Verify confirm - token + paciente (so depois do codigo)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"token\", () => pm.expect(r.token).to.be.a('string'));",
              "pm.test(\"paciente vem (objeto ou null)\", () => pm.expect(r).to.have.property('paciente'));",
              "if (r.paciente) pm.test(\"so primeiro nome\", () => pm.expect(r.paciente.nome).to.not.match(/\\s/));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", r.token);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{BOOKING_API_KEY}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/{{ENVIRONMENT}}/public/clinics/{{clinicId}}/verify/confirm",
          "host": [
            "{{BASE_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{ENVIRONMENT}}",
            "public",
            "clinics",
            "{{clinicId}}",
            "verify",
            "confirm"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{ \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\", \"code\": \"{{code}}\" }"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Quote com celular e token - conhecido, preco da pessoa com motivo, sem nome",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const q = pm.response.json().quote;",
              "pm.test(\"cadastro.conhecido e booleano\", () => pm.expect(q.cadastro.conhecido).to.be.a('boolean'));",
              "pm.test(\"faltam e lista\", () => pm.expect(q.cadastro.faltam).to.be.an('array'));",
              "pm.test(\"nenhum nome na cotacao\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.match(/nome|name/));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{BOOKING_API_KEY}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/{{ENVIRONMENT}}/public/clinics/{{clinicId}}/quote",
          "host": [
            "{{BASE_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{ENVIRONMENT}}",
            "public",
            "clinics",
            "{{clinicId}}",
            "quote"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"serviceIds\": [\"{{serviceId}}\"],\n  \"serviceAreaPairs\": [{ \"serviceId\": \"{{serviceId}}\", \"areaId\": \"{{areaId}}\" }],\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"token\": \"{{token}}\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Precisa do token de /verify/confirm (24/11). Com ele o motivo do desconto pode vir: quem le ja provou ser o dono do numero."
      }
    },
